4. Repeat.","procedure":["1. **Hardware Setup (DC Motor with L293D and Arduino):**
    *   Connect Arduino GND to one GND pin of the L293D.
    *   Connect Arduino 5V to VCC1 (logic supply) of L293D.
    *   Connect an external power supply (e.g., 9V battery) to VCC2 (motor supply) of L293D and its GND to L293D GND and Arduino GND.
